+3. Build runtime image with vendor SDK in isolated builder environment (templates under ops/hw/dockerfiles/).
+4. Deploy nodepool, label nodes, update helm chart nodeSelector/tolerations.
+5. Run validation & perf tests (ops/hw/validation/* and ops/ci/*).
+
+Important: All vendor SDK installs and image builds must happen in trusted build environments and follow vendor licensing.
